## Or-patterns

```catala
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A content integer
  -- B content integer
  -- C content (integer, money)
  -- D content (money, integer)
  -- F

declaration scope S:
  input v content E
  output o content integer
  output b content boolean
  output t1 content boolean
  output t2 content boolean
  output t3 content boolean
  output t4 content boolean

scope S:
  definition o equals
    match v with pattern
    -- A content x or B content x: x
    -- FirstLongConstructorName content (a, b)
       or SecondLongConstructorName content (b, a):
      a
    -- C content (x, y) or D content (y, x): x
    -- anything: 0

  definition b equals
    match v with pattern
    -- A or B: true or false
    -- C
    or D
    or F: false

  definition t1 equals v with pattern (A or B)

  definition t2 equals v with pattern (A or B) or v with pattern F

  definition t3 equals
    v with pattern (A content x or B content x) and x > 2

  definition t4 equals
    v with pattern (FirstLongConstructorName
    or SecondLongConstructorName
    or ThirdLongConstructorName)
```
